bco:TimeReporting ex:enablesProcess ex:P10857 .
bco:TimeReporting rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:TimeReporting rdfs:label "Time Reporting"@en .
bco:TimeReporting rdfs:subClassOf bco:BusinessCapability .
bco:TimeReporting skos:definition "A business capability of an organization to record, by period, the time its members work, are absent or bill, and make that record available to those who pay, bill or plan with it, grounded in the organization's members as organized."@en .

bco:TradeDocumentation ex:enablesProcess ex:P14093 .
bco:TradeDocumentation ex:enablesProcess ex:P14094 .
bco:TradeDocumentation ex:enablesProcess ex:P14095 .
bco:TradeDocumentation ex:enablesProcess ex:P19593 .
bco:TradeDocumentation rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:TradeDocumentation rdfs:label "Trade and Customs Documentation"@en .
bco:TradeDocumentation rdfs:subClassOf bco:BusinessCapability .
bco:TradeDocumentation skos:definition "A business capability of an organization to prepare and keep the records of its cross-border shipments, value them and calculate the duty on them, and give customs authorities the declarations they call for, grounded in the organization's members as organized."@en .

bco:TradePreferenceManagement ex:enablesProcess ex:P14096 .
bco:TradePreferenceManagement rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:TradePreferenceManagement rdfs:label "Trade Preference Management"@en .
bco:TradePreferenceManagement rdfs:subClassOf bco:BusinessCapability .
bco:TradePreferenceManagement skos:definition "A business capability of an organization to establish that its goods qualify for reduced or zero duty under trade agreements and programs, and claim and document that treatment, grounded in the organization's members as organized."@en .

bco:TradeProductClassification ex:enablesProcess ex:P14092 .
bco:TradeProductClassification rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:TradeProductClassification rdfs:label "Trade Product Classification"@en .
bco:TradeProductClassification rdfs:subClassOf bco:BusinessCapability .
bco:TradeProductClassification skos:definition "A business capability of an organization to classify the goods and services it trades under the tariff and control classifications that apply to them, grounded in the organization's members as organized."@en .

bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement ex:enablesProcess ex:P10886 .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement ex:enablesProcess ex:P10887 .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement ex:enablesProcess ex:P10888 .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement ex:enablesProcess ex:P10889 .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement ex:enablesProcess ex:P10890 .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement rdfs:label "Treasury Policy Management"@en .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement rdfs:subClassOf bco:BusinessCapability .
bco:TreasuryPolicyManagement skos:definition "A business capability of an organization to formulate, publish and keep current the rules and procedures under which its treasury invests, borrows, hedges and handles cash, grounded in the organization's members as organized."@en .
